authoring_notes = "Step 7C S002 draft. Wreck Field exploration after S001 combat: Cyanis reads survivor routes, unstable wreckage, enemy pressure, civilian positions, and evidence that the clean northern withdrawal line may be bait through ordinary battlefield awareness. He gives survivors practical roles based on what they can still do. The actual pursuit-order refusal remains S003; Ilyra arrival and the damaged Card response remain S004. No proof portrait asset is promoted into canon."
