"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 520, "staging": "Return from S001's opening combat into the damaged east side of the convoy. Smoke, broken wagon parts, wounded escorts, and displaced travelers establish the Wreck Field without a triumphant victory beat.", "camera": "Readable wide of the east-side wreckage, then settle near Cyanis.", "movement": "Cyanis lowers his shield only after checking the immediate approach.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["RESUME_AFTER_S001_COMBAT", "CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B002",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "Dovaren.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "A wounded escort calls from beside the road, one hand braced against a broken wheel.", "camera": "Medium in-world framing.", "movement": "Cyanis turns immediately.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B003",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Where?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "He asks for locations, not a condition report he can see for himself.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "Cyanis closes the distance while scanning beyond the escort.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B004",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "Two by the axle. One under the canvas.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 50, "staging": "The escort points rather than explaining injuries they cannot assess.", "camera": "Pan only enough to establish the two survivor positions.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "CIVILIAN_POSITION_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B005",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Can you stand?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "Cyanis checks the escort's usable capacity instead of ordering them as if unwounded.", "camera": "Hold two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B006",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "If I have to.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "The answer is strained but credible.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "The escort tests their weight before committing.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B007",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "You do. Get the two by the axle behind the stone line. Don't lift anyone you can't.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 60, "staging": "A useful task sized to what the wounded escort can still do; Cyanis does not turn them into a porter beyond their condition.", "camera": "Show the stone-line route he means.", "movement": "Escort begins toward the two survivors.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SURVIVOR_ROLE_ASSIGNMENT", "SURVIVOR_ROUTE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B008",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "What about the one under the canvas?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The escort checks the remaining casualty rather than assuming Cyanis missed them.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "Escort pauses only long enough for the answer.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B009",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Mine.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 90, "staging": "Conclusion first. Cyanis immediately moves toward the trapped survivor.", "camera": "Follow Cyanis into the field.", "movement": "Escort continues to the stone line; Cyanis moves toward the damaged wagon.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B010",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 120, "staging": "Release the player into the first authored Wreck Field traversal segment. Survivor-route markers, unstable wreckage, and visible threat directions should be legible through environment/staging rather than a tutorial narration dump.", "camera": "Return to exploration camera.", "movement": "Player control resumes with the trapped-survivor interaction as the immediate nearby objective.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["PLAYABLE_WRECK_FIELD_EXPLORATION", "HANDOFF_TO_EXPLORATION"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B011",
"speaker_id": "civilian_traveler",
"text": "Sir—my brother's under there.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "At the damaged wagon, a traveler is crouched near a sagging frame and trying to find a way underneath.", "camera": "Medium on traveler, trapped survivor location, and unstable frame in one readable composition.", "movement": "Cyanis steps between the traveler and the unsafe opening.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "UNSTABLE_WRECKAGE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B012",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Don't crawl under the frame.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 25, "staging": "Immediate safety instruction; he does not soften it until the traveler is out of the danger line.", "camera": "Hold the unstable load in frame.", "movement": "Cyanis gestures the traveler back half a step.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B013",
"speaker_id": "civilian_traveler",
"text": "He's right there.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "Fear makes the traveler answer the urgency rather than the instruction.", "camera": "Brief trapped-survivor insert, then back.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B014",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "I know. Can you pull?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "Cyanis redirects the traveler from panic into a concrete job.", "camera": "Two-shot.", "movement": "Cyanis checks the wagon's loaded side and an available rope/line.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SURVIVOR_ROLE_ASSIGNMENT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B015",
"speaker_id": "civilian_traveler",
"text": "Yes.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "The traveler focuses on the task.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "Traveler takes the line Cyanis indicates.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B016",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Good. Rope around that spoke. When I lift, pull him toward you. Not up. Toward you.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 50, "staging": "Short instructions matched to the physical problem. No miracle strength or magical solution.", "camera": "Keep hand placement and extraction direction readable.", "movement": "Cyanis braces at the safe side of the frame while the traveler takes position.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "UNSTABLE_WRECKAGE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B017",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 420, "staging": "Cyanis lifts only enough to relieve the pin while the traveler pulls the trapped survivor clear. The damaged wagon shifts after extraction, confirming the danger he read.", "camera": "Close functional action, then widen as the frame settles lower.", "movement": "Survivor is moved to clear ground; Cyanis releases the load safely rather than holding it theatrically.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT", "WRECK_RESCUE_COMPLETED"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B018",
"speaker_id": "civilian_traveler",
"text": "He's breathing.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "Relief without turning the rescue into a victory speech.", "camera": "Traveler with survivor.", "movement": "Traveler stays beside the survivor.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B019",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Keep him on his side. If he stops answering, shout.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "Basic field instruction only; Cyanis does not perform expert medical diagnosis outside his authority.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "Cyanis rises and looks back across the field.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B020",
"speaker_id": "civilian_traveler",
"text": "You're leaving?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The question is practical fear, not an emotional test.", "camera": "Two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B021",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Twenty steps. Shout if he changes.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 100, "staging": "He answers with distance and responsibility rather than reassurance he cannot guarantee.", "camera": "Follow his sight line toward the next part of the wreck field.", "movement": "Cyanis moves on; traveler remains with the survivor.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "SURVIVOR_ROUTE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B022",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 120, "staging": "Resume short playable traversal. The direct center road is visibly compromised by a rear wagon resting on a failed axle; the lower stone line remains the safer survivor route. Movement remains visible along the hostile ridge beyond the wreckage.", "camera": "Exploration camera with ridge and center-road hazards readable when approached.", "movement": "Player may move between the rescued travelers and the next escort position.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["PLAYABLE_WRECK_FIELD_EXPLORATION", "SURVIVOR_ROUTE_READ", "UNSTABLE_WRECKAGE_READ", "ENEMY_PRESSURE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B023",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Nobody uses the middle road. Rear wagon's sitting on one axle.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "Cyanis reaches the wounded escort again as survivors begin moving along the lower stone line.", "camera": "Keep failed axle visible behind them.", "movement": "Cyanis indicates the blocked center route.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "UNSTABLE_WRECKAGE_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B024",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "That's the shortest way back.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The escort raises the obvious practical objection.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B025",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "It'll get shorter when the wagon lands on somebody.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 70, "staging": "Dry practical absurdity under pressure; the line ends the argument rather than turning into banter.", "camera": "Small creak/settle from the damaged wagon can underline the point without slapstick.", "movement": "Cyanis redirects the survivor flow toward the stone line.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B026",
"speaker_id": "wounded_convoy_escort",
"text": "Right. Stone line.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 60, "staging": "The escort accepts the correction immediately.", "camera": "Widen toward moving survivors.", "movement": "Escort waves two travelers onto the safer route.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S002_B027",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Stone line.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 100, "staging": "Simple confirmation while Cyanis's attention shifts toward a new sound near the ditch.", "camera": "Begin turning toward the ditch line.", "movement": "Cyanis stops.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
